#: ../../user_2fa.rst:3
msgid "Using two-factor authentication"
msgstr "Brug af to-faktor-godkendelse"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:5
msgid ""
"Two-factor authentication (2FA) is a way to protect your Nextcloud account "
"against unauthorized access. It works by requiring two different 'proofs' of"
" your identity. For example, *something you know* (like a password) and "
"*something you have* like a physical key. Typically, the first factor is a "
"password like you already have and the second can be a text message you "
"receive or a code you generate on your phone or another device (*something "
"you have*). Nextcloud supports a variety of 2nd factors and more can be "
"added."
msgstr ""
"To-faktor-godkendelse (2FA) er en måde at beskytte din Nextcloud-konto mod "
"uvedkommende adgang på. Den kræver to forskellige 'beviser' for din "
"identitet, for eksempel *noget, du ved* (som en adgangskode) og *noget, du "
"har*, som en fysisk nøgle. Typisk er den første faktor en adgangskode, som "
"du allerede har, og den anden kan være en sms, du modtager, eller en kode, "
"du genererer på din telefon eller en anden enhed (*noget, du har*). "
"Nextcloud understøtter flere slags anden faktor, og der kan tilføjes flere."

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:14
msgid ""
"Once a two-factor authentication app has been enabled by your administrator,"
" you can enable and configure it in :doc:`userpreferences`."
msgstr ""
"Når din administrator har slået en app til to-faktor-godkendelse til, kan du"
" slå den til og sætte den op i :doc:`userpreferences`."

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:18
msgid "Configuring two-factor authentication"
msgstr "Opsætning af to-faktor-godkendelse"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:20
msgid ""
"In your personal settings, look up the **Second-factor Auth** setting. In "
"this example this is TOTP, a Google Authenticator compatible time-based "
"code:"
msgstr ""
"Find indstillingen **To-faktor-godkendelse** i dine personlige "
"indstillinger. I dette eksempel er det TOTP, en tidsbaseret kode, der virker"
" med Google Authenticator:"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:23
msgid "TOTP configuration."
msgstr "Opsætning af TOTP."

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:26
msgid ""
"You will see your secret and a QR code which can be scanned by the TOTP app "
"on your phone (or another device). Depending on the app or tool, type in the"
" code or scan the QR and your device will show a login code which changes "
"every 30 seconds."
msgstr ""
"Du ser nu din hemmelige nøgle og en QR-kode, som du kan scanne med TOTP-"
"appen på din telefon (eller en anden enhed). Afhængigt af appen eller "
"værktøjet skal du indtaste koden eller scanne QR-koden, hvorefter din enhed "
"viser en loginkode, der skifter hvert 30. sekund."

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:32
msgid "Recovery codes if you lose your second factor"
msgstr "Backup-koder, hvis du mister din anden faktor"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:34
msgid ""
"You should always generate backup codes for 2FA. If your second factor "
"device gets stolen or stops working, you can use one of these codes to "
"unlock your account. It effectively functions as a backup second factor. To "
"get the backup codes, go to your personal settings and look under **Second-"
"factor Auth** settings. Choose *Generate backup codes*:"
msgstr ""
"Du bør altid oprette backup-koder til 2FA. Hvis din enhed til anden faktor "
"bliver stjålet eller holder op med at virke, kan du bruge en af koderne til "
"at låse din konto op. Den fungerer altså som en reserve for anden faktor. Du"
" får backup-koderne i dine personlige indstillinger under **To-faktor-"
"godkendelse**. Vælg *Generer backup-koder*:"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:40
msgid "2FA backup code generator"
msgstr "Generering af backup-koder til 2FA"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:43
msgid "You will then see a list of one-time-use backup codes:"
msgstr "Så ser du en liste med backup-koder, der hver kan bruges én gang:"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:45
msgid "2FA backup codes"
msgstr "Backup-koder til 2FA"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:48
msgid ""
"Store these codes somewhere safe where you can find them. Do not keep them "
"with your second factor (such as your mobile phone), but store them "
"separately so that losing one does not mean losing the other."
msgstr ""
"Gem koderne et sikkert sted, hvor du kan finde dem. Opbevar dem ikke sammen "
"med din anden faktor (f.eks. din mobiltelefon), men et andet sted, så du "
"ikke mister begge dele på én gang."

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:53
msgid "Logging in with two-factor authentication"
msgstr "Log ind med to-faktor-godkendelse"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:55
msgid ""
"After you log out and log in again, you will see a prompt to enter the TOTP "
"code in your browser. If you have enabled more than one second factor, you "
"will see a selection screen where you can choose which method to use for "
"this login. Select TOTP:"
msgstr ""
"Når du logger ud og ind igen, bliver du bedt om at indtaste TOTP-koden i din"
" browser. Hvis du har slået mere end én anden faktor til, ser du et "
"skærmbillede, hvor du kan vælge, hvilken metode du vil bruge til dette "
"login. Vælg TOTP:"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:60
msgid "Choosing a two-factor authentication method."
msgstr "Valg af metode til to-faktor-godkendelse."

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:63
msgid "Now, just enter your code:"
msgstr "Indtast din kode:"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:65
msgid "Entering TOTP code at login."
msgstr "Indtastning af TOTP-kode ved login."

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:68
msgid ""
"If the code was correct you will be redirected to your Nextcloud account."
msgstr ""
"Hvis koden er korrekt, bliver du sendt videre til din Nextcloud-konto."

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:71
msgid ""
"Since the code is time-based, it is important that your server's and your "
"smartphone's clock are almost in sync. A time drift of a few seconds won't "
"be a problem."
msgstr ""
"Da koden er tidsbaseret, er det vigtigt, at uret på din server og på din "
"smartphone går nogenlunde ens. En forskel på nogle få sekunder er ikke et "
"problem."

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:76
msgid "Using two-factor authentication with hardware tokens"
msgstr "Brug af to-faktor-godkendelse med hardware-nøgler"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:78
msgid ""
"You can use two-factor authentication based on hardware tokens. The "
"following devices are known to work:"
msgstr ""
"Du kan bruge to-faktor-godkendelse med hardware-nøgler. Det er kendt, at "
"følgende enheder virker:"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:80
msgid "TOTP based:"
msgstr "TOTP-baserede:"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:82
msgid ""
"`Nitrokey Pro <https://shop.nitrokey.com/shop/product/nitrokey-pro-2-3>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Nitrokey Pro <https://shop.nitrokey.com/shop/product/nitrokey-pro-2-3>`_"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:83
msgid "`Nitrokey Storage <https://shop.nitrokey.com/shop>`_"
msgstr "`Nitrokey Storage <https://shop.nitrokey.com/shop>`_"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:85
msgid "FIDO2 based:"
msgstr "FIDO2-baserede:"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:87
msgid ""
"`Nitrokey FIDO2 <https://shop.nitrokey.com/shop/product/nkfi2-nitrokey-"
"fido2-55>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Nitrokey FIDO2 <https://shop.nitrokey.com/shop/product/nkfi2-nitrokey-"
"fido2-55>`_"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:88
msgid ""
"`Nitrokey FIDO U2F <https://shop.nitrokey.com/shop/product/nitrokey-"
"fido-u2f-20>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Nitrokey FIDO U2F <https://shop.nitrokey.com/shop/product/nitrokey-"
"fido-u2f-20>`_"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:91
msgid "Using client applications with two-factor authentication"
msgstr "Brug af klienter med to-faktor-godkendelse"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:93
msgid ""
"Once you have enabled 2FA, your clients will no longer be able to connect "
"with just your password unless they also have support for two-factor "
"authentication. To solve this, you should generate device-specific passwords"
" for them. See :doc:`session_management` for more information on how to do "
"this."
msgstr ""
"Når du har slået 2FA til, kan dine klienter ikke længere forbinde med kun "
"din adgangskode, medmindre de også understøtter to-faktor-godkendelse. "
"Løsningen er at oprette enhedsspecifikke adgangskoder til dem. Se "
":doc:`session_management` for at få flere oplysninger om, hvordan du gør."

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:100
msgid "Considerations"
msgstr "Overvejelser"

#: ../../user_2fa.rst:102
msgid ""
"If you use WebAuthn to log in to your Nextcloud, be sure to not use the same"
" token for 2FA, as this would mean you are again only using a single factor."
msgstr ""
"Hvis du bruger WebAuthn til at logge ind på din Nextcloud, så sørg for ikke "
"at bruge den samme nøgle til 2FA, da du så igen kun bruger én faktor."
